 tgrep-cli/src/serve.rs            | 133 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 tgrep-cli/src/serve/poll_tests.rs |   1 +
 tgrep-core/src/walker.rs          |  14 ++--
 4 files changed, 130 insertions(+), 27 deletions(-)

